n rat liver and kidney</article-title><source>J Cell Biol</source><year>1984</year><volume>98</volume><fpage>1696</fpage><lpage>1704</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">6373783</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1083/jcb.98.5.1696</pub-id></citation></ref></ref-list></back></article>